message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Cross-species transfer learning from HIV-1 to HIV-2 for protease inhibitor resistance prediction: biophysical features and external clinical validation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Nunna"
    given-names: "Jaswanth Sriram"
    affiliation: "Department of Artificial Intelligence & Engineering, Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Bengaluru, India"
